<title>FRANCE: EdF to gain 850 mln Ffr from Sydkrfat stake sale.</title>
<headline>EdF to gain 850 mln Ffr from Sydkrfat stake sale.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The chairman of Electricite de France (EdF), Edmond Alphandery, said on Wednesday the French utility was eying a capital gain of 850 million francs from the sale of its 10 percent stake in Sweden's Sydkraft AB.</p>
<p>Alphandery provided the details at a press conference.</p>
<p>In a statement released earlier EdF said it was selling the stake to Norwegian power company Statkraft for 2.13 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
